# Agents 0, 1 and 2 are never given an order. They stand in a line across the
# middle; agents 3 to 6 are sent past them.
# Catches an arrived agent that stops reserving its cell, which makes a
# stationary unit invisible and gets it walked through.
version 1
map hall.map
tick 0.016666667
agent 0 5 4
agent 1 5 5
agent 2 5 6
agent 3 1 5
agent 4 1 6
agent 5 2 5
agent 6 2 6
order 0 3,4,5,6 9 5
end 250
